"候选人":[{"text":"他是那个职位最有希望的候选人。","en":"He was the strongest candidate for the position.","source":"tatoeba","id":2411006,"enId":291051,"by":"fenfang557","grades":{"hsk3_2025":{"level":null,"highestKnownLevel":6,"coverage":0.5,"unlisted":["他是","那个","最有","候选"]},"hsk2":{"level":null,"highestKnownLevel":6,"coverage":0.625,"unlisted":["他是","那个","最有"]}}},{"text":"我从来不是最有可能获得这一职务的候选人。我们刚开始并没有太多资金，也没有得到许多人的支持。我们的竞选活动并非始自华盛顿的大厅里，而是始于得梅因、康科德、查尔斯顿这些地方的普通民众家中。那些辛勤工作的人们从自己微薄的储蓄中捐出5美元、10美元、20美元。","en":"I was never the likeliest candidate for this office. We didn't start with much money or many endorsements. Our campaign was not hatched in the halls of Washington. It began in the backyards of Des Moines, and the living rooms of Concord, and the front porches of Charleston. It was built by working men and women who dug into what little savings they had to give $5 and $10 and $20 to the cause.","source":"tatoeba","id":347829,"enId":347765,"by":"zhouj1955","grades":{"hsk3_2025":{"level":null,"highestKnownLevel":7,"coverage":0.6764705882352942,"unlisted":["不是","最有","候选","太多","也没有","人的","始","华盛顿","而是","梅","康","德","尔","斯顿","家中","人们","微薄","捐出","美元"]},"hsk2":{"level":null,"highestKnownLevel":6,"coverage":0.47058823529411764,"unlisted":["不是","最有","刚","并","没有","太多","也没有","得到","人的","始","自","华盛顿","大厅","而是","于","梅","因","康","科","德","查","尔","斯顿","这些","普通","民众","家中","那些","人们","微薄","中","捐出","美元"]}}},{"text":"被击败的候选人要求重新计算选票","source":"aishell3","id":"SSB10550227","grades":{"hsk3_2025":{"level":null,"highestKnownLevel":5,"coverage":0.6666666666666666,"unlisted":["击败","候选","选票"]},"hsk2":{"level":null,"highestKnownLevel":6,"coverage":0.7777777777777778,"unlisted":["击败","选票"]}},"pinyin":"bei4 ji1 bai4 de5 hou4 xuan3 ren2 yao1 qiu2 chong2 xin1 ji4 suan4 xuan3 piao4","audio":"audio/aishell3/SSB1055/SSB10550227.mp3"},{"text":"基金管理公司有四名候选人","source":"aishell3","id":"SSB10560134","grades":{"hsk3_2025":{"level":null,"highestKnownLevel":6,"coverage":0.7142857142857143,"unlisted":["四名","候选"]},"hsk2":{"level":